#37000
Credit where it's due, holmes~
   This is an area meant for multiple groups to be able to xp if desired.  The
theme is one thousand years ago machines dominated every facet of life.  Mother
nature didn't approve, so she slowly took it back.  Now all that remains is the
area here.  The zone is inside of a building and has an east and west side.  
The levels for the xp can be set later in RavenMUD 3.  0.  The zone has some
mobs that are aggro, some mobs that can't see in the dark, and some optional
mobs.  These optional mobs can be set by specific room and object triggers that
load the mobs to fight.  These triggers purge themselves after one use so
players can't abuse them and will only be allowed to trigger on zone resets.  
The optional mobs will offer more the way of experience but will be much tougher
to fight offering incentive for players to group for the xp.  Any players
entering the zone on a reset where previous players have entered, zone echos
will work the other group of players that someone else has entered.  The area is
left open at the beginning for future projects.  Lots of descriptions, a few
death traps, key, triggers, a little bit of everything here.  The area
eventually leads to a 100 room city with plenty to offer.

Zone Reset Time: Negotiable
Mob Levels: Negotiable
Zone Start: 18001
Connecting Zone Start: 19601
Maps/Notes: Available on Request
Area contains: Mobs, triggers, portals, some equipment, locked doors, keys, dt's, hidden descriptions, optional mobs
